{"type": "info", "prompt": "A contest is about this help me win\n\n@Tangem is paying 1,000 USDC to creators who can explain one thing simply:\n\nhow to keep your crypto safe, the seedless way", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Keep Your Crypto Safe: The Seedless Way</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --bg: #070B12;\n  --surface: #0F1626;\n  --surface-subtle: #141E33;\n  --border: #1E2D4A;\n  --text-main: #F8FAFC;\n  --text-muted: #94A3B8;\n  --mint: #00E599;\n  --cyan: #00C2FF;\n  --coral: #FF4D6D;\n  --font-main: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background-color: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  font-family: var(--font-main);\n}\n\nmain {\n  width: 1080px;\n  height: 1350px;\n  padding: 64px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 22px;\n}\n\n/* Header */\n.header-tag {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  background: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.12);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.35);\n  color: var(--mint);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  width: fit-content;\n}\n\n.header-tag svg {\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 10px 0 6px;\n  font-size: 64px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\nh1 span {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), var(--cyan));\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 25px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* Hero Metric Strip */\n.hero-strip {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.hero-box {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 24px 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.hero-box.highlight {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.08) 0%, rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.04) 100%);\n  border-color: rgba(0, 229, 153, 0.4);\n}\n\n.stat-row {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.stat-num {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 68px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--mint);\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n}\n\n.stat-num.danger {\n  color: var(--coral);\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.hero-desc {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 23px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* 3-Step Process Cards */\n.section-title-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.section-label {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n\n.section-note {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.steps-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 18px;\n}\n\n.step-card {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 14px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.step-top {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.step-pill {\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--surface-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n}\n\n.step-card h3 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.step-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.chip-spec {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  background: rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.08);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 194, 255, 0.25);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 19px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--cyan);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Comparison Table */\n.comparison-card {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 26px 28px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.comp-header {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 1fr;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.comp-header .th-old { color: var(--coral); }\n.comp-header .th-new { color: var(--mint); text-align: left; }\n\n.comp-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 1fr;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 23px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n.comp-row .feature {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.comp-row .bad {\n  color: #F87171;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.comp-row .good {\n  color: var(--mint);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Footer Banner */\nfooter {\n  margin-top: auto;\n  background: var(--surface-subtle);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 16px 24px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.footer-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.badge-seal {\n  background: var(--mint);\n  color: #051A12;\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n\n  <!-- Top Title Header -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"header-tag\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n        <path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path>\n      </svg>\n      Tangem Hardware Architecture\n    </div>\n    <h1>Crypto Safety: The <span>Seedless</span> Way</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Writing 24 recovery words on paper is the #1 point of failure in crypto. Here is how card-to-card hardware cryptography replaces seed phrases entirely.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Hero Proof / Metric Strip -->\n  <div class=\"hero-strip\">\n    <div class=\"hero-box\">\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <span class=\"stat-num danger\">$1.4B+</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Lost to Phishing</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">Over 80% of personal wallet drains happen when users are tricked into exposing, photographing, or pasting their paper seed words.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-box highlight\">\n      <div class=\"stat-row\">\n        <span class=\"stat-num\">0</span>\n        <span class=\"stat-label\">Words To Steal</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">With Tangem, keys are born inside an EAL6+ microchip. They never display on any screen and cannot be typed anywhere.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- The 3 Pillars of Seedless Security -->\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"section-title-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-label\">How Tangem Eliminates The Seed Phrase</div>\n      <div class=\"section-note\">End-to-end chip-grade protection</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"steps-grid\">\n    <!-- Step 1 -->\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">01</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\"/>\n          <line x1=\"9\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"4\"/>\n          <line x1=\"9\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"23\"/><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"23\"/>\n          <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"14\"/>\n          <line x1=\"1\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"9\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"14\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>Chip-Born Isolation</h3>\n      <p>The chip generates a high-entropy private key internally during setup. The key never leaves the secure element under any condition.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">Samsung EAL6+ Certified</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 2 -->\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">02</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--mint)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>Multi-Card Backup</h3>\n      <p>Instead of writing phrases, you tap 2 or 3 cards together. Keys transfer across an encrypted Diffie-Hellman channel directly between chips.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">3 Cards = 0 Single Fail Point</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 3 -->\n    <div class=\"step-card\">\n      <div class=\"step-top\">\n        <div class=\"step-pill\">03</div>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--cyan)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M6 18h8\"/>\n          <path d=\"M3 22h18\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M10 10v8\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <h3>NFC Physical Tap</h3>\n      <p>To transfer crypto, tap your physical card to your phone. Transactions are signed on the chip. Malicious websites cannot drain you remotely.</p>\n      <div class=\"chip-spec\">Antenna Off When In Pocket</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Head-to-Head Comparison -->\n  <div class=\"comparison-card\">\n    <div class=\"comp-header\">\n      <span style=\"color: var(--text-muted);\">Security Vector</span>\n      <span class=\"th-old\">Paper Seed Phrase</span>\n      <span class=\"th-new\">Tangem Seedless Card</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"comp-row\">\n      <span class=\"feature\">Phishing Resistance</span>\n      <span class=\"bad\">&#10005; Hackers can trick you to type it</span>\n      <span class=\"good\">&#10003; Impossible: no words exist</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"comp-row\">\n      <span class=\"feature\">Physical Durability</span>\n      <span class=\"bad\">&#10005; Paper burns, rots, and fades</span>\n      <span class=\"good\">&#10003; IP68 waterproof, -25°C to +50°C</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"comp-row\">\n      <span class=\"feature\">Physical Theft Defense</span>\n      <span class=\"bad\">&#10005; Anyone who reads the paper wins</span>\n      <span class=\"good\">&#10003; Protected by custom Access Code</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"comp-row\">\n      <span class=\"feature\">Wallet Recovery</span>\n      <span class=\"bad\">&#10005; Type 24 words manually on screen</span>\n      <span class=\"good\">&#10003; Instant tap with backup card</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">\n      <span class=\"badge-seal\">EAL6+</span>\n      <span>Top military & banking security rating • Audited by Kudelski Security</span>\n    </div>\n    <div>25+ Year Chip Guarantee • Tangem AG</div>\n  </footer>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>", "size": [1080, 1350]}, "edits": [], "created": 1792446299.1331904}